@MyMovieProject_HostAddress = http://localhost:5227

GET {{MyMovieProject_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@movieApiToken = paste-a-valid-jwt-here

### Search movies with title, category, and pagination (requires JWT)
GET {{MyMovieProject_HostAddress}}/api/movies/search?search=Batman&categoryId=2&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{movieApiToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### List users (requires Admin JWT)
GET {{MyMovieProject_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{movieApiToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Change a user's role (requires Admin JWT)
PUT {{MyMovieProject_HostAddress}}/api/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer {{movieApiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Author"
}

###
